{"Version":2,"ProgramText":"INKG WHITE\nSCREEN SELECT 1\nFONT SET 70,100,\u0022Courier New\u0022\nPRINTG AT 1,7,\u0022PHALANX\u0022\nFONT SET 30,50,\u0022Courier New\u0022\nPRINTG AT 2,8,\u0022RULES\u0022\n\nSCREEN SELECT 0\n\n;PARTICLE 2,40\n\nSAM LOOP \u0022Sound/rain.mp3\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Regnet \u00F6ser ner...\u0022\n\nDOUBLE BUFFER\n\nx=0\nLoop:\n  x=x\u002B1\n  IF x=300 THEN\n    GOTO slut\n  ENDIF\n  WAIT VBL\nGOTO Loop\n\nslut:\nSAM STOP \u0022Sound/rain.mp3\u0022\nPRINT \u0022Regnet slutade.\u0022","ScreenWidth":null,"ScreenHeight":null,"Sprites":null,"MapWidth":null,"MapHeight":null,"MapData":null}